('P4A-U04-L2.p2.evidence',2,'P4A-U04-L2',3,'reading.P4A-U04','reading-evidence','evidence','{"title":"迷路的小狗有线索","gradeMin":4,"id":"P4A-U04-L2.p2.evidence","type":"evidence","category":"reading","context":"读小故事，先选支持答案的原句，再回答问题。","prompt":"Tom昨天丢了什么？","passage":[{"id":"s1","text":"Yesterday, Tom lost his red dog lead."},{"id":"s2","text":"His sister found it under a bench."},{"id":"s3","text":"She gave it back to Tom."}],"choices":["a red dog lead","a green ball","a blue coat"]}','{"answers":["[\"s1\",\"a red dog lead\"]"],"evidenceSolutions":[{"sentenceId":"s1","answer":"a red dog lead"}],"family":"fact-1235198c62b1c865","hint":"回到原文找人物、地点、物品或因果；所选句子必须支持答案。","explanation":"依据：Yesterday, Tom lost his red dog lead. 对应答案：a red dog lead。","solutionSentences":["Yesterday, Tom lost his red dog lead."]}','published'),
