('P4B-U02-L1.p8.input',2,'P4B-U02-L1',3,'grammar.past-simple','controlled-production','input','{"title":"节日采访用Did提问","gradeMin":4,"id":"P4B-U02-L1.p8.input","type":"input","category":"tense","context":"询问Bo昨天下午是否参观了模型展。","prompt":"Did Bo ___ the model display yesterday afternoon?（visit）"}','{"answers":["visit"],"family":"fact-b3eb16f0e2ebc569","hint":"询问过去做没做某事用Did加主语加动词原形。Did承担过去的标记，所以后面不再用过去式。节庆安排均为虚构班级故事。","explanation":"Did Bo visit the model display yesterday afternoon? Bo昨天下午参观模型展了吗？Did后用动词原形visit。","solutionSentences":["Did Bo visit the model display yesterday afternoon?"]}','published'),
('P4B-U06-L1.p8.input',2,'P4B-U06-L1',3,'grammar.negation.past-simple','controlled-production','input','{"title":"昨天发生的小故事","gradeMin":4,"id":"P4B-U06-L1.p8.input","type":"input","category":"tense","context":"班级没有拍摄私人笔记的照片，补一个动词原形。","prompt":"The class did not ___ photos of the private notes.（take）"}','{"answers":["take"],"family":"fact-12f3688faec5c0fd","hint":"讲昨天已结束的动作，肯定句用一般过去时；did或didn''t后面的主要动词用原形。过去时间词提供线索，但也要读整句，不把一次经历当成经常发生的事。","explanation":"The class did not take photos of the private notes. 班级没有拍摄私人笔记的照片，补一个动词原形。 讲昨天已结束的动作，肯定句用一般过去时；did或didn''t后面的主要动词用原形。过去时间词提供线索，但也要读整句，不把一次经历当成经常发生的事。","solutionSentences":["The class did not take photos of the private notes."]}','published'),
('P4B-U06-L4.p8.input',2,'P4B-U06-L4',3,'reading.sequence','controlled-production','input','{"title":"一封有时间线索的短信","gradeMin":4,"id":"P4B-U06-L4.p8.input","type":"input","category":"tense","context":"按给定顺序补一个词，表示最后一步：草图、折纸、检查。","prompt":"First we sketched, next we folded, and ___ we checked the model."}','{"answers":["finally","lastly"],"family":"fact-f084523704a7b39e","hint":"finally或lastly都可以引出最后一步；这里前两步是sketched和folded。","explanation":"finally / lastly。两者在这里都可以表示最后一步。","solutionSentences":["First we sketched, next we folded, and finally we checked the model."]}','published'),
